|---|---:|---|
| `20e71c95be9f496026e8133aeae11d86fbd6f7d79ed86f31b4a3e757e011484a` | **176,223 (100.000%)** | **fallback** |
| normal-engine digest | 0 (0.000%) | normal |

All 176,223 rows across all 180 anchors and both training worlds were built by
the fallback. No row in the shipped corpus came from the normal path.

