codex
Anchor 1 completed at 1.005 GiB peak RSS. Baseline exact was 61.985 s versus 0.954 s fallback; enabling coalition raised exact to 64.963 s and fallback to 4.061 s. Coalition explains the evaluation-count configuration behind the old 632.83/4.79 comparison, but not its tenfold exact runtime—source/engine vintage or machine state is also material. Three more carriers/world samples are running.
